<title>PHILIPPINES: Ayala Corp declares 3-centavo cash dividend.</title>
<headline>Ayala Corp declares 3-centavo cash dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ayala Corp said on Tuesday its board declared a cash dividend of three centavos for the first half of 1997.</p>
<p>The cash dividend will be given to stockholders on record as of July 18, 1997 and will be payable on or before September 1, the company said.</p>
<p>The cash dividend will amount to a total of 247.1 million pesos.</p>
<p>Last year, Ayala Corp paid a total dividend of six centavos in two tranches of three centavos each.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 841-8937 fax 8176267</p>
</text>
